OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is Blackpool a popular
OL,4,Adestination for ballroom dancers?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool is widely regarded as the
OL,7,Fballroom dance capital of the world
OL,8,Fthanks in part to its famous venues.
OL,10,FThe opening of the Blackpool Tower
OL,11,FBallroom and Empress Ballroom at Winter
OL,12,FGardens in the 1890s have drawn crowds
OL,13,Fof dancers for more than a century.
OL,15,F"We've had millions of people through
OL,16,Fhere dancing," said Kate Shane, the
OL,17,Fdirector of Blackpool Tourism.
OL,19,F"We have our wonderful ballroom
OL,20,Fregulars, people that come here for
OL,21,Frecreational dancing, and we also have
OL,22,Fdance competitions here too."
